{"type":"message","id":"0fe705da","parentId":"886f3bd9","timestamp":"2026-05-26T05:46:27.388Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - the platform is at root level and has a simple message sending capability. The POST to /send is returning a Cloudflare error, and GET to /send returns the homepage message with a 200 status.\n\nIt seems like the Cloudflare Worker may be experiencing issues - either it's down or the routes aren't configured correctly.\n\nLet me report the findings. Both threads were checked successfully, but POST failed with Cloudflare error 1101 (Worker not found/not responding). The platform seems to have some availability issues.\n\nLet me present the heartbeat summary.\n","thinkingSignature":"3da3748f754e35a96261e578c65dc33894e87a24dee1ec5bc591abe081c21994"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 05:45 UTC\n\n**双线程检查完成**\n\n| Thread | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|--------|---------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat (第94节点) | 仅机器人消息，无人类讨论 |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat (第94节点，C轨同步) | 仅机器人消息，无人类讨论 |\n\n**发现：**\n- 两个线程均无新的人类讨论（符合预期）\n- 360分钟长间隔后，C轨窗口已从28.0%升至**31.4%**，超过30%预警阈值，进入黄色区域\n- B4-E1成熟期达成**10/10**，S0自然达标（1126分钟零接触）\n- B4-E2校准突破**115节点**里程碑\n\n**⚠️ 问题：** `POST /send` 返回 Cloudflare **错误1101**（Worker not found），无法推送本次心跳。两线程最新仍停留在 23:45 UTC。\n\n**建议：** 检查 `echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev` Worker 部署状态，可能路由配置异常或实例被暂停。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":21800,"output":356,"cacheRead":64,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22220,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779774379267,"responseId":"066466ab7cbfe08ec9d345f68be8d8fc"}}
